# Inspect actual completed OAuth work. No launch, regeneration or credentials.
name: Real OAuth context reaches explicit Map review and survives restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_context_receipts.py @TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-context
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | real-context-result
expect: m Review Map
ask: Does the real completed job offer exact inspection and separate Map review without claiming its unknown dollar usage is zero?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-context
expect: Components: 3
ask: Can the operator inspect the exact live-generated context without activating it or starting another job?
keys: v
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | live-dfd
keys: Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 notes mapping | selected-notes-mapping
ask: Can the operator navigate to the notes mapping in the real diagram while keeping exact context and back controls visible?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: dfd-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: dfd-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: dfd-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: dfd-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: dfd-40x12
ask: At the smallest viewport, can the operator still inspect and return from the real diagram without losing the exact context?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Enter diagram | narrow-details
keys: End
live-snap: narrow-details-tail
ask: Does actual detail paging at 40x12 reach the selected component's final context while preserving its identity and return controls?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Enter details | returned-narrow-diagram
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restored-exact-context
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | returned-result
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | pending-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_context_receipts.py @TARGET @ART pending
ask: Does the source-bound completed Map remain unaccepted until the visible operator action, with no additional model request?
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_context_receipts.py @TARGET @ART accepted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 20 accepted | durable-map
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | durable-dfd
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 accepted | restored-map
expect: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_context_receipts.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After no-color restart, does accepted context and its live request accounting persist without source changes, global activation or new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
